<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-INDIA 2-0 IN SECOND INNINGS AT CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 2-0 IN SECOND INNINGS AT CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN, Barbados 1997-03-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>India, set 120 runs for victory by the West Indies, were two without loss at the close on the third day of the the third test at Kensington Oval on Sunday after the West Indies were bowled out for 140 in their second innings.</p>
<p>Scores: West Indies 298 (S. Chanderpaul 137 not out, V. Prasad 5-82) and 140 (B.Lara 45, A.Kuruvilla 5-68,</p>
<p>India 319 (S.Tendulkar 92, R.Dravid 78).</p>
